surname>Staerfeldt</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ussery</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A DNA structural atlas for <italic>Escherichia coli</italic></article-title><source>J Mol Biol</source><year>2000</year><volume>299</volume><fpage>907</fpage><lpage>930</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10843847</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/jmbi.2000.3787</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brukner</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Sanchez</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Suck</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Pongor</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sequence-dependent bending propensity of DNA as revealed by DNase I: parameters for trinucleotides</article-title><source>EMBO J</source><year>1995</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>1812</fpage><lpage>1818</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7737131</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dlakic</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ussery</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunak</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>DNA bendability and nucleosome positioning in transcriptional regulation</article-title><source>DNA Conformation in Transcription</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>Ohyama T: Landes Bioscience</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Blot</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Mavathur</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Geertz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Travers</surname><given-names>A</given-name